// Self-playing demo of the day-POC.
//
// Same UI as `npm run day` — mission card, per-turn coaching, NPC voice,
// Aoi in the meadow — but the "player" turns are generated by an AI
// student instead of typed by a human. Use this to show a friend what
// the loop feels like without making them know Japanese.
//
// Run with:
//   npm run day-demo
//   npm run day-demo -- --no-music
//   npm run day-demo -- --no-tts
//   npm run day-demo -- --player-voice Puck
//   npm run day-demo -- --pace 0.7        # 0.4 (fast) … 1.5 (slow)

